---
kind: scene
id: common.exam
title: Midterm
on: slotStart
when: "run.day == 4 && run.slot == 'morning'"
priority: 10
after: 'visited("common.injury")'
---

## The exam hall

::bg{location="hall" time="morning"}
::music{action="start" mood="tense" volume="down"}
@headmistress: Pens down when the bell goes, not after. Anyone failing today spends every afternoon until the festival in remedial study.
@you{mono when="quest.studyGroup.state == 'complete'"}: Soren's handwriting is still on my notes. Dates in blue, kings in green.

::exam{subject="history" resultKey="midterm"}

<match on="scene.exam.midterm.grade">
  <when is="top">
    ::set{run.exam = 'top'}
    @headmistress: Top of the year. From a transfer. Well.
    @soren{os emotion="surprised"}: That's — that's my rank you took. I don't mind. I don't mind at all.
    ::set{run.aff.soren += 1}
  </when>
  <when is="pass">
    ::set{run.exam = 'pass'}
    @headmistress: A pass. Adequate.
  </when>
  <when is="fail">
    ::set{run.exam = 'fail'}
    @headmistress: Remedial study. The annex, every afternoon. The library is not the annex.
    @you{mono}: The library is where Soren is. Was. Will be, without me.
    ::assert{locked(soren)}
  </when>
</match>

@narrator{when="scene.exam.midterm.score >= 95"}: The score is pinned to the board by lunch. Somebody has drawn a small lantern next to it.
